Z||000000||Gokart||02-08-2000||07:07 PM||||When a sensor starts to s**t the bed will you always get a code? I know the O2 sensor will set one off, but which ones could go on me and I'd never know?||||reg||5
Z||000001||theogre||02-08-2000||08:14 PM||||TPS only sets a code if it fails completely. It's likely been bad long before that. <P>Temp sensors will set codes if they open. they may set bogus codes if they are out of calibration.||||reg||1
